//! What the calling family's operations hold beyond their operands.

import compiler.check.types (Type)
import compiler.emit.keys (Callee)

/// `ConstantRead` what a pure definition of no parameters and no type variables answers, run once
/// and kept for good by the unit as a value of `kept`, the type the definition answers, a
/// `constant` one a `const fn`, whose raise ends the run; `Observed` its one operand, read into a
/// value the C compiler knows nothing of, so what made the operand runs even where nothing else
/// reads it.
pub type CallingOp = | ConstantRead({ callee: Callee, kept: Type, constant: Bool }) | Observed
